{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53165","headline":"送最澄上人还日本国 · 孟光","name":"送最澄上人还日本国","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁来求请，新年受法归。\n衆香随贝叶，一雨润禅衣。\n素舸轻翻浪，征帆背落晖。\n遥知到本国，相见道流稀。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}